cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use StrixGeo in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: StrixGeo
abstract: >-
  StrixGeo is a ground model platform for geotechnical data: CPTs, boreholes,
  lab tests and PDF reports go in, and a validated three-level subsurface
  model with characterisation outputs and exports to design tools comes out.
